# TextFSM template for budget_owner
Value LABEL (NO\ DEPARTMENT|TAXES|NEW\ YORK)
Value CHANNA (FINANCE)
Value DENNIS (MARKETING)
Value DEREK (SUBLIME)
Value DOUG (TECHNOLOGY)
Value ERIC (DRIVER\ OPERATIONS\ \-\ BAY)
Value JAY (EXECUTIVE)
Value LINDA (ADMINISTRATION)
Value RAJ (DRIVER\ OPERATIONS\ \-\ SACRAMENTO)
Value WENDY (INVENTORY\ \-\ WHOLESALE)

Start
  ^.*${LABEL}.* -> Record
  ^.*${CHANNA}.* -> Record
  ^.*${DENNIS}.* -> Record
  ^.*${DEREK}.* -> Record
  ^.*${DOUG}.* -> Record
  ^.*${ERIC}.* -> Record
  ^.*${JAY}.* -> Record
  ^.*${LINDA}.* -> Record
  ^.*${RAJ}.* -> Record
  ^.*${WENDY}.* -> Record